OL,3,CProgramme listings for WED 13 MAY
OL,4,G0400FOwain Wyn Evans
OL,5,     GWelcome! It's Early Breakfast
OL,6,     Gwith Owain Wyn Evans, featuring
OL,7,     GStep Back in Time. Today we ask
OL,8,     Gyou about the events that you
OL,9,     Ghave been to that not enough
OL,10,     Gpeople rave about!
OL,11,G0630FThe Gary Davies Breakfast Show
OL,12,     GAngela Scanlon calls Gary from
OL,13,     GVienna with all the gossip from
OL,14,     Glast night's Eurovision 2026 semi-
OL,15,     Gfinal. They also look ahead to
OL,16,     Gtomorrow's semi-final, and
OL,17,     GSaturday's Grand Final.
